AppleLocalAI uses the LiteRT-LM core runtime as an external SwiftPM dependency.
The macOS package does not contain a copied LiteRT-LM Foundation Models adapter
or executor; the canonical adapter and model inspection are provided by the
AppleLocalAI iOS dependency declared in Package.swift.

The local CGImagePNG.swift helper retains the attribution in its source header.
The external LiteRT-LM runtime and its prebuilt artifacts retain their upstream
Apache License, Version 2.0 and attribution.
